  "MatterTitle": "An ordinance to authorize building material restrictions and requirements for BL2026-1471, a proposed Specific Plan Zoning District for properties located at Curtis Street (unnumbered), Lincoln Avenue (unnumbered), and 2305 and 2307 Lloyd Avenue, at the northwest corner between Curtis Street and Lloyd Avenue (6.32 acres), to permit 62 multi-family residential units, all of which is described herein (Proposal No. 2026SP-026-001). THE PROPOSED ORDINANCE REQUIRES CERTAIN MATERIALS TO BE RESTRICTED IN THE CONSTRUCTION OF BUILDINGS.",
